80561926"}]}, "change_log": "0.12.4.9 - Onboarding improvements and bug fixes\n\n- Added interactive deck elements to new user onboarding and paywall section\n- Video Call hosts can now move themselves to the audience\n- Added a Sign Out function across all streaming services\n- Added an indication when a room is full\n- Fixed track pack music disappearing from the Tribe playlist on restart\n- Fixed Video Call URL display mismatch in the client (space encoding)\n- Fixed menu break when starting the Dance Game as a multiplayer spectator\n- Fixed mixing hours achievement not formatting hours correctly\n- Fixed points not accruing for the 2,500 track achievement\n- Fixed Twitch login not persisting between sessions on some Quest devices\n- Fixed Social Menu refresh arrow rotating the wrong direction\n- Fixed Beat Grid Adjust being blocked on V10 or CDJ3K with no mixer screen", "created_date": 1782156936, "id": "27529855013322428", "version": "0.12.4.9", "version_code": 2253, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "27529851029989493"}, "asset_files": {"count": 33}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}